// @name: Additive synthesis — 8 stacked poscil partials
// @tagline: harmonic vs. inharmonic additive synthesis, 8 summed sine partials per note
// @description: Exemple canonique tiré du FLOSS Manual Csound, chapitre « Additive Synthesis »
// (exemple 04A01.csd, Andrés Cabrera). Deux instruments : le premier somme 8 partiels harmoniques
// (ibasefrq * 1,2,3…8), le second des partiels légèrement désaccordés (inharmonique, style cloche).
// Synthèse pure (poscil sur giSine), pas de fichier externe. À comparer côte à côte avec l'original:
// https://files.csound-tutorial.net/floss_manual/Release01/Cs_FM_01_epub/ch023_a-additive-synthesis.xhtml.
// @language: csound
// @outputs: audio
// @level: intermediate
// @tags: csound, ab-corpus, additive, oscillator
// @source: https://files.csound-tutorial.net/floss_manual/Release01/Cs_FM_01_epub/ch023_a-additive-synthesis.xhtml
//
// A/B — csound — Additive (8 poscil). Original: FLOSS Manual, chapitre Additive Synthesis.
// Coller/évaluer la voix, puis comparer au rendu de l'outil original.
// Le moteur DOIT booter sur ce backtick en entier (CSD complet).

@core
@tempo:120

@actor v  eval.csound

S -> v

v -> `<CsoundSynthesizer>
<CsOptions>
-odac
</CsOptions>
<CsInstruments>
;example by Andrés Cabrera
sr = 44100
ksmps = 32
nchnls = 2
0dbfs = 1

giSine    ftgen     0, 0, 2^10, 10, 1

    instr 1 ;harmonic additive synthesis
ibasefrq  =         cpspch(p4)
ibaseamp  =         ampdbfs(p5)
aOsc1     poscil    ibaseamp, ibasefrq, giSine
aOsc2     poscil    ibaseamp/2, ibasefrq*2, giSine
aOsc3     poscil    ibaseamp/3, ibasefrq*3, giSine
aOsc4     poscil    ibaseamp/4, ibasefrq*4, giSine
aOsc5     poscil    ibaseamp/5, ibasefrq*5, giSine
aOsc6     poscil    ibaseamp/6, ibasefrq*6, giSine
aOsc7     poscil    ibaseamp/7, ibasefrq*7, giSine
aOsc8     poscil    ibaseamp/8, ibasefrq*8, giSine
kenv      linen     1, p3/4, p3, p3/4
aOut = aOsc1 + aOsc2 + aOsc3 + aOsc4 + aOsc5 + aOsc6 + aOsc7 + aOsc8
          outs      aOut*kenv, aOut*kenv
    endin

    instr 2 ;inharmonic additive synthesis
ibasefrq  =         cpspch(p4)
ibaseamp  =         ampdbfs(p5)
aOsc1     poscil    ibaseamp, ibasefrq, giSine
aOsc2     poscil    ibaseamp/2, ibasefrq*1.02, giSine
aOsc3     poscil    ibaseamp/3, ibasefrq*1.1, giSine
aOsc4     poscil    ibaseamp/4, ibasefrq*1.23, giSine
aOsc5     poscil    ibaseamp/5, ibasefrq*1.26, giSine
aOsc6     poscil    ibaseamp/6, ibasefrq*1.31, giSine
aOsc7     poscil    ibaseamp/7, ibasefrq*1.39, giSine
aOsc8     poscil    ibaseamp/8, ibasefrq*1.41, giSine
kenv      linen     1, p3/4, p3, p3/4
aOut = aOsc1 + aOsc2 + aOsc3 + aOsc4 + aOsc5 + aOsc6 + aOsc7 + aOsc8
          outs aOut*kenv, aOut*kenv
    endin

</CsInstruments>
<CsScore>
; f 0 3600 garde le moteur vivant 1 h — requis en live coding.
f 0 3600
i 1 0 5    8.00      -10
i 1 3 5    9.00      -14
i 1 5 8    9.02      -12
i 1 6 9    7.01      -12
i 1 7 10   6.00      -10
s
i 2 0 5    8.00      -10
i 2 3 5    9.00      -14
i 2 5 8    9.02      -12
i 2 6 9    7.01      -12
i 2 7 10   6.00      -10
</CsScore>
</CsoundSynthesizer>`:34
